  "question": {
    "text": "The correct statement(s) for orthoboric acid is/are",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "HoEdH",
      "text": "It behaves as a weak acid in water due to self ionization.",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Dw8ty",
      "text": "Acidity of its aqueous solution increases upon addition of ethylene glycol.",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zWnRQ",
      "text": "It has a three dimensional structure due to hydrogen bonding.",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "OqQ0J",
      "text": "It is a weak electrolyte in water.",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>A]  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>  is a weak monobasic Lewis acid.<br > <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <br >B] Equilibrium (i) is shifted in forward direction by the addition of syn-diols like ethylene glycol which forms a stable complex with  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> .<br > <br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image7-ca6686b1-cc81-4cbf-8a9c-8caeb7858619.jpg\"/> <br >C] It has a planar sheet like structure due to hydrogen bonding.<br >D]  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>  is a weak electrolyte in water.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
